% Printed the way Chrome and Skia print text: a Type3 font in a y-down glyph
% space whose char codes number its glyphs, a descriptor without /Ascent or
% /Descent, one glyph per Tj, and a space drawn as an inkless glyph of its
% own. The heading's CSS letter-spacing (-0.03em) puts each glyph 0.6 short of
% its /Widths advance.
